是专门负责收购的
is in charge of acquisitions.

186
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:42,490
或许他们只是想花大钱买你的发明
So maybe they just want to give you a lot of money for your invention.

187
00:07:42,530 --> 00:07:45,080
拜托  事情肯定不是这样子
Oh, please, that's not how it works.

188
00:07:45,080 --> 00:07:47,540
你也看过《E.T.》《阿凡达》《侏罗纪世界》吧
You saw  E.T., Avatar, Jurassic World.

189
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:52,200
军方就是跑来接管一切的恶霸
The military just shows up and takes over.

190
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,860
你应该知道那些都不是纪录片吧
You do realize those weren't documentaries, right?

191
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,990
不好意思  你觉得很好笑吗
I'm sorry, you find this funny?

192
00:07:58,990 --> 00:08:01,400
不啊  我只是在回味《侏罗纪世界》
No, I was just thinking about Jurassic World.

193
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:03,720
那真是部烂片
Boy, that was terrible.

194
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,720
我们得走楼梯
Oh, we have to use the stairs.

195
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,330
电梯什么时候能修好
When are they gonna fix your elevator?

196
00:08:16,330 --> 00:08:18,770
我不知道  随时吧
Uh... I don't-- any day now.

197
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:21,030
走楼梯也行
Well, the stairs are fine.

198
00:08:21,590 --> 00:08:23,950
再说了  你妈就在楼上
Besides, your mother is up there.

199
00:08:24,700 --> 00:08:25,890
或许我走着走着心脏病发
Maybe I'll have a heart attack

200
00:08:25,890 --> 00:08:27,200
就不用见她了
and not have to see her.

201
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:33,000
我知道你和老妈的关系
Hey, I, I know things are a little rough

202
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,160
有点僵
with you and Mom,

203
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:36,070
但我真的很高兴你能来
but I'm really glad you're here.

204
00:08:36,070 --> 00:08:37,220
我也是
Me, too.

205
00:08:40,710 --> 00:08:42,610
我真不应该做血管修复术
I should have never had that angioplasty

206
00:08:42,610 --> 00:08:45,020
因为完全没有要病发的样子
because I feel fine.

207
00:08:48,050 --> 00:08:49,790
佩妮很期待能见到你
Penny's really looking forward to seeing you.

208
00:08:49,790 --> 00:08:51,650
她是个可人儿
Ah, she's a sweetie.

209
00:08:51,650 --> 00:08:53,930
你娶了一个好老婆  莱纳德
You got a good one there, Leonard.

210
00:08:53,930 --> 00:08:55,740
多谢  爸爸
Thanks, Dad.

211
00:08:57,010 --> 00:08:59,360
你是怎么娶到好老婆的啊
How the hell did you do that?

212
00:09:23,300 --> 00:09:25,370
真是和乐融融啊
Isn't this nice?

213
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:27,960
我们到了
Hey, we're here.

214
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,920
阿尔弗雷德
Alfred!

215
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:30,560
感谢你能来
Thank you for coming!

216
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:32,530
很高兴能来
Well, happy to be here.

217
00:09:32,530 --> 00:09:34,140
-恭喜你们  -谢谢
- And congratulations. - Thank you.

218
00:09:34,140 --> 00:09:35,420
爸爸  这是谢尔顿
Dad, you remember Sheldon.

219
00:09:35,420 --> 00:09:36,330
霍夫斯塔德博士
Dr. Hofstadter.

220
00:09:36,330 --> 00:09:37,390
库珀博士
Dr. Cooper.

221
00:09:37,390 --> 00:09:38,880
这是谢尔顿的母亲  玛丽
This is Sheldon's mother, Mary.

222
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,620
你好
How do you do?

223
00:09:39,620 --> 00:09:40,680
很高兴见到你
Nice to meet you.

224
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:42,040
这是他的女朋友  艾米
And his girlfriend, Amy.

225
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:42,830
你好
A pleasure.

226
00:09:42,830 --> 00:09:43,390
你好
Hi.

227
00:09:43,390 --> 00:09:44,520
当然  还有我妈
And, of course, Mom.

228
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:47,180
你好  可憎的悍妇
Hello, my hateful shrew.

229
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,550
你也好  皱巴巴的老王八蛋
Hello to you, you wrinkled old bastard.

230
00:09:56,330 --> 00:09:59,190
好吧  现在我能感觉到气氛有点紧张了
All right, now I'm starting to sense a little tension.

231
00:10:04,980 --> 00:10:07,210
行了  你们俩不要开吵
All right, you two, don't start.

232
00:10:07,210 --> 00:10:10,230
我和佩妮是为了你们才再办一次婚礼
Penny and I are throwing this second wedding for your benefit.

233
00:10:10,230 --> 00:10:11,670
拜托不要毁了它好吗
Can you please not ruin it?

234
00:10:11,670 --> 00:10:13,230
当然  很抱歉
Of course. I'm sorry.

235
00:10:13,230 --> 00:10:14,950
瞧瞧  原来你会道歉啊
Oh, look at that-- you can apologize.

236
00:10:14,950 --> 00:10:15,360
妈
Mom!

237
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,000
抱歉
I'm sorry.

238
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,870
《圣经》说宽恕...
You know, the Bible says forgiveness...

239
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:19,520
妈
Mom!

240
00:10:19,520 --> 00:10:20,830
抱歉
I'm sorry.

241
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,890
饿了吧
Uh, who's hungry?

242
00:10:22,890 --> 00:10:25,490
我们在城里最棒的餐厅订了位哦
We have a reservation at the best restaurant in town.

243
00:10:25,490 --> 00:10:27,130
那餐厅在点评网上只有三颗半星
It only got three-and-a-half stars on Yelp.

244
00:10:27,130 --> 00:10:27,810
谢尔顿
Sheldon!

245
00:10:27,810 --> 00:10:30,090
我不觉得抱歉  我说的是事实
I'm not sorry. That's true.

246
00:10:32,210 --> 00:10:33,230
我不知道该怎么办
I don't know what to do.

247
00:10:33,230 --> 00:10:34,780
对方可是美国空军
It's the Air Force.

248
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:36,870
我是该回复这封邮件
I mean, should I respond to their e-mail?

249
00:10:36,870 --> 00:10:37,860
还是置之不理
Ignore it?

250
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:38,850
你不能置之不理
You can't ignore it.

251
00:10:38,850 --> 00:10:42,970
这又不是牙医发来让你回去做检查的贺卡
It's not that postcard that says it's time to go back to the dentist.

252
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:44,560
小哥俩  走吧
Guys, come on.

253
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:45,560
我们约了大家吃饭呢
We're meeting everyone for dinner.

254
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,880
稍等  我就怕万一我回复了
One sec. I'm just afraid if I respond,

255
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,520
他们就知道我的项目成功了
then they'll know I got it.

256
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,050
伙计
Oh, dude.

257
00:10:50,050 --> 00:10:51,530
你点开邮件的那一刻
The minute you opened that e-mail,

258
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:52,400
他们就知道你成功了
they knew you got it.

259
00:10:52,400 --> 00:10:53,390
没准他们现在就通过
I mean, they're probably looking at you

260
00:10:53,390 --> 00:10:54,750
电脑的摄像头监视你呢
through the camera right now.

261
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:56,050
我勒个去
Oh, damn.

262
00:10:57,990 --> 00:11:00,050
我爱美国哟
I love America.

263
00:11:02,060 --> 00:11:03,290
你们闹够了没有
Are you done with this nonsense?

264
00:11:03,290 --> 00:11:04,400
这不是闹着玩的
It's not nonsense.

265
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,720
美国军方就是这么办事儿的
This is how the U.S. Military works.

266
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,290
就算是美国军方好了
Oh, if it's even the U.S. Military.

267
00:11:08,290 --> 00:11:11,680
那也可以是假装成美方的外国军方势力
It could be foreign military pretending to be American.

268
00:11:11,680 --> 00:11:13,590
你说得对  我们一旦把导向系统给了他们
You're right. We turn our guidance system over to them,

269
00:11:13,590 --> 00:11:16,470
他们会立即拿来对付美国
next thing we know, they're using it against us.

270
00:11:18,150 --> 00:11:21,290
我也爱美国的敌人们哟
I also love the enemies of America.

271
00:11:29,530 --> 00:11:32,960
佩妮  希望我和莱纳德父亲的
Penny, I hope the example of my failed marriage

272
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:35,150
失败婚姻并没有让你
to Leonard's father doesn't discourage you

273
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:37,490
对你俩的婚姻失去信心
from the commitment you've made to one another.

274
00:11:37,490 --> 00:11:39,990
当然不会
Oh, of course not.

275
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:44,820
不过我和阿尔弗雷德的感情比你们的深厚
Although Alfred and I had a lot more going for us than you two.

276
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:49,770
妈  多留几句"好话"祝酒时说吧
Mom, please save something for the toast.

277
00:11:54,250 --> 00:11:56,760
阿尔弗雷德  你是做什么的
So, Alfred, what is it that you do for a living?

278
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,290
我是一名人类学家
Oh, I'm an anthropologist.

279
00:11:58,290 --> 00:12:00,240
我研究古人和古文化
I study ancient peoples and cultures.

280
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,190
老天  就是史前大洪水之前的一切吗
My goodness, so all the way back to the Flood.

281
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:03,190
《圣经》中记载了挪亚时代发生的全球大洪水
也就是诺亚方舟故事的由来

282
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:08,390
别笑  她刚不是开玩笑
Don't laugh-- she wasn't joking.

283
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:10,560
玩你的手机  别多事
Play with your phone.

284
00:12:14,640 --> 00:12:15,680
关于这一点
Well, on that note,

285
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:18,410
在很多不同国家的文化中  他们的神话里
there are many cultures that have an apocalyptic flood

286
00:12:18,410 --> 00:12:20,250
都有过末日大洪水的记载
as part of their mythology.

287
00:12:20,250 --> 00:12:21,610
我不信神话
I don't have a mythology.

288
00:12:21,610 --> 00:12:23,470
我只信永远正确的上帝之话
I have the unerring Word of God.

289
00:12:23,470 --> 00:12:25,250
但你说的非常有意思
But that's very interesting.

290
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,210
我没有看不起你的信仰的意思
I-I didn't mean to disparage your faith.

291
00:12:28,210 --> 00:12:29,950
其实我挺欣赏的
Actually, I admire it.

292
00:12:29,950 --> 00:12:31,090
-真的吗  -当然
- Really? - Yes.

293
00:12:31,090 --> 00:12:32,770
我自己是不可知论者
Yes, I'm an agnostic myself,

294
00:12:32,770 --> 00:12:35,260
但我曾祷告过很多次  祈求上帝
but I have prayed, many times, to God,

295
00:12:35,260 --> 00:12:39,060
将我妻子变成一根盐柱
to turn my wife into a pillar of salt.

296
00:12:35,260 --> 00:12:39,060
《圣经》里的典故  上帝将一个人的妻子变成盐柱

297
00:12:39,530 --> 00:12:41,040
也算接近了吧
Well, He came close.

298
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,370
把她变成一块大冰块
Turned her into a giant block of ice.

299
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:49,700
霍华德  大学里肯定可以找到
Howard, there must be someone at the university

300
00:12:49,700 --> 00:12:51,170
能帮你的人吧
you can go to for help.

301
00:12:51,490 --> 00:12:52,480
开什么玩笑
Are you kidding?

302
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,870
没准就是他们先把消息
They're probably the ones who leaked it

303
00:12:53,870 --> 00:12:56,510
透漏给军方的
to the military in the first place.

304
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:00,120
那第四台新闻里那哥们呢
What about the guy on the Channel Four News?

305
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:01,970
总说"第四与你同一阵线"
You know, "Four on Your Side"?

306
00:13:01,970 --> 00:13:04,620
也许他也可以来你的阵线
Maybe he can be on your side.

307
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:07,810
我是被政府骚扰
I'm being harassed by the government,

308
00:13:07,810 --> 00:13:11,630
不是想弄清诈骗骗局真相
not trying to get to the bottom of a dog-walking scam.

309
00:13:12,380 --> 00:13:14,280
够了
Oh, stop!

310
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:15,850
你知道真相是什么吗
You know what's really happening?

311
00:13:15,850 --> 00:13:17,150
所有你看过的电影
All the movies you've watched,

312
00:13:17,150 --> 00:13:18,510
电视剧  漫画书
the TV shows, the comic books--

313
00:13:18,510 --> 00:13:20,440
将你的想法彻底扭曲了
they've completely twisted your thinking.

314
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:21,960
没人在追查你  没人在监听你
No one's after you, no one's listening to you,

315
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:24,550
根本没人在乎你
no one cares about you.

316
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:27,000
我还是希望
I'd like to think

317
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:30,280
"第四与你同一阵线"那哥们是在乎我的
the "Four on Your Side" guy cares about me.

318
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:34,650
贝弗莉  我知道你和阿尔弗雷德
You know, Beverly, I know you and Alfred

319
00:13:34,650 --> 00:13:37,080
有你们的分歧  但其实你想一下
have your differences, but if you think about it,

320
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:40,130
如果你没嫁给他  就不会有莱纳德了
if you hadn't married him, there'd be no Leonard.

321
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:42,660
所以也是好事  对不对
So that's good, right?

322
00:13:42,660 --> 00:13:43,760
对吧
Yeah.

323
00:13:49,780 --> 00:13:52,030
前面是霍华德吗
Is that Howard in front of us?

324
00:13:52,030 --> 00:13:53,200
好像是
Oh, maybe.

325
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,870
跟上他们
Get closer.

326
00:13:56,930 --> 00:13:58,300
天啊
Oh, God.

327
00:13:58,300 --> 00:14:00,370
好像有人跟踪我们
I think someone's following us.

328
00:14:02,050 --> 00:14:03,140
你在自己脑补
You're being ridiculous.

329
00:14:03,140 --> 00:14:06,370
真不是我脑补  他就跟在后面
I'm not being ridiculous-- he's right on my tail.

330
00:14:06,680 --> 00:14:09,900
在这左转  看他们会不会跟着转
Uh, turn left here and see if he turns with us.

331
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:12,410
他为什么在这转弯
Well, why is he turning here?

332
00:14:12,410 --> 00:14:13,560
饭店在另一边
The restaurant's the other way.

333
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,460
不知道
I don't know.

334
00:14:14,460 --> 00:14:16,980
他有用一款路况软件  可能前头出车祸了吧
He uses that traffic app. Maybe there's an accident.

335
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:18,870
那跟他走吧
Oh, so follow him.

336
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:22,460
不好
Oh, no!

337
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,570
我就说吧
I told you!

338
00:14:26,570 --> 00:14:29,090
可能只是巧合而已
It's probably just a coincidence.

339
00:14:29,090 --> 00:14:31,560
加点速  看他会不会跟上来
Speed up a little, see if he stays with you.

340
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,090
你快点开
Well, go faster.

341
00:14:33,090 --> 00:14:33,950
要跟丢了
You're losing him.

342
00:14:33,950 --> 00:14:34,950
他怎么那么急
What is his hurry?

343
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:35,800
这样  你闪一下车灯
You know what, flash your lights.

344
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,620
让他知道是你
Let him know it's you.

345
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,330
他在闪灯
He's flashing his lights.

346
00:14:39,330 --> 00:14:40,650
那是什么意思
What's that mean?

347
00:14:40,650 --> 00:14:42,640
他好像想让我们靠边停
I-I think he wants us to pull over.

348
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:43,560
不许靠边停
Do not pull over!

349
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:46,200
我才不要当单亲妈妈
I'm not raising this baby alone!

350
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,610
坐稳了
Hang on!

351
00:14:52,860 --> 00:14:54,890
你丈夫去世以后
So, after your husband passed,

352
00:14:54,890 --> 00:14:56,050
你没有再嫁吗
you never remarried?

353
00:14:56,050 --> 00:14:59,140
没有  全情投入在工作和教堂上了
No, just focused on work and the church.

354
00:14:59,140 --> 00:15:00,590
你是做什么工作的
Ah. And what do you do?

355
00:15:00,590 --> 00:15:02,660
在教堂工作
I work at the church.

356
00:15:04,660 --> 00:15:06,220
有你在  是他们三生有幸
Well, they're lucky to have you.

357
00:15:06,220 --> 00:15:08,200
谢谢
Well, thank you.

358
00:15:08,780 --> 00:15:10,190
不客气
You're welcome.

359
00:15:10,190 --> 00:15:12,650
你看出来是怎么回事了吗
Do you realize what's happening here?

360
00:15:12,650 --> 00:15:13,900
当然了
Yeah, I do.

361
00:15:13,900 --> 00:15:17,030
他们面包吃太多  一会该吃不下饭了
They're filling up on bread and ruining their meal.

362
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:21,900
你们怎么那么晚
What took you guys so long?

363
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:24,630
我们本来跟着霍华德来着  但不知道怎么
Oh, we were following Howard, but for some reason,

364
00:15:24,630 --> 00:15:28,210
他把车灯关掉逆着单行道走了
he turned off his headlights and went up a one-way street.

365
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:29,990
你们聊什么了
So, what did we miss?

366
00:15:29,990 --> 00:15:32,730
不过是我和玛丽彼此了解一下
Oh, just Mary and I getting to know each other a little.

367
00:15:32,730 --> 00:15:34,860
莱纳德  你父亲真是讨人喜欢
Leonard, your father is just charming.

368
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:35,790
他还破产了
He's also broke.

369
00:15:35,790 --> 00:15:37,690
他没有告诉你吗
Did he mention that?

370
00:15:39,810 --> 00:15:43,150
好的  妈  你去那边坐
Okay, Mom, you sit over there...

371
00:15:44,230 --> 00:15:46,880
我给伯纳黛特打电话  问问怎么这么久
And I'm gonna call Bernadette and see what's keeping them.

372
00:15:47,870 --> 00:15:49,790
我要是早知道你破产了
If I'd known you were broke,

373
00:15:49,790 --> 00:15:52,740
就不会那么在意你多吃面包了
I wouldn't have made a big deal about the bread.

374
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,600
佩妮
Hey, Penny.

375
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:01,330
你说什么呢
What are you talking about?

376
00:16:03,620 --> 00:16:05,880
刚刚那是你啊
Oh, that was you?

377
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:08,240
说来话长
Long story.

378
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:09,570
你们先吃吧
Why don't you go ahead and eat.

379
00:16:09,570 --> 00:16:11,520
我们恐怕还要一会儿呢
We're gonna be a while.

380
00:16:15,270 --> 00:16:17,200
我跟你说  我没嗑药
I'm telling you, I'm not on drugs.

381
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:19,480
是政府要抓我
The government's out to get me!

382
00:16:23,470 --> 00:16:26,140
最近一个比较有趣的新发现
Now, one of the more exciting things to be found recently

383
00:16:26,140 --> 00:16:27,880
就是尼安德塔人[穴居人]
is that Neanderthals

384
00:16:27,880 --> 00:16:30,990
与智人[现代人类祖先]  常会与彼此交配
and Homosapiens frequently mated with each other.

385
00:16:30,990 --> 00:16:32,540
这下我就明白
Well, that certainly explains

386
00:16:32,540 --> 00:16:34,670
为什么我会嫁给谢尔顿的父亲了
my marriage to Sheldon's father.

387
00:16:37,060 --> 00:16:41,340
非常好笑  因为我父亲不是特别聪明的人
That's funny, because my father was not a very clever man.

388
00:16:41,730 --> 00:16:44,270
没有你"我什么都听不懂了"
I'd be lost without you.

389
00:16:47,230 --> 00:16:49,180
我想邀大家举杯
Uh, I would like to propose a toast

390
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:51,240
敬我的妻子兼准新娘
to my wife and bride-to-be.

391
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,570
你看  这句好笑的点在...
See, that's funny because...

392
00:16:52,570 --> 00:16:54,290
玩你手机去
Back to your phone.

393
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:57,610
佩妮
Penny...

394
00:16:58,450 --> 00:17:00,260
我爱你  这点毋庸置疑
I've always known I loved you,

395
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:02,880
但过去的这一年让我意识到
but this last year has shown me

396
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:05,990
我也爱上了活在围城里的感觉
that I also love being married to you.

397
00:17:05,990 --> 00:17:07,670
谢谢你愿意嫁给我
Thank you for saying yes.

398
00:17:08,030 --> 00:17:10,540
谢谢你始终没放弃
Oh, thanks for asking until I did.

399
00:17:11,500 --> 00:17:12,670
说得好
Hear, hear.

400
00:17:12,670 --> 00:17:14,140
干杯
Cheers.

401
00:17:16,050 --> 00:17:18,500
我也想举杯
I, uh, I would also like to make a toast.

402
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:20,920
莱纳德
Leonard,

403
00:17:20,920 --> 00:17:23,480
我很高兴  看到你找到了一位
I am so happy that you have found a woman

404
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:24,950
爱你又关心你的女人
who loves and cares for you.

405
00:17:24,950 --> 00:17:27,520
你什么意思给老娘讲清楚
What the hell is that supposed to mean?

406
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,970
你该吃药了
Why don't you take a pill?

407
00:17:30,970 --> 00:17:33,340
就像你上床之前那样吗
Like you did before sex?

408
00:17:33,970 --> 00:17:36,430
其实当时我最想要的是眼罩
What I really needed was a blindfold.

409
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:38,050
好了  各位
All right, everyone...

410
00:17:38,050 --> 00:17:38,990
冷静点
calm down.

411
00:17:38,990 --> 00:17:41,280
我们想想《圣经》里是怎么说的
Let's all remember what it says in the Bible:

412
00:17:41,280 --> 00:17:43,330
"不轻易发怒的
"He who is slow to anger

413
00:17:43,330 --> 00:17:44,940
胜过勇士"
is better than the mighty."

414
00:17:44,940 --> 00:17:48,910
你这女人  能看看别的书吗
Oh, dear woman, can you please read another book?

415
00:17:49,740 --> 00:17:52,780
只要上帝出新作  我就追
When God writes one, I will.

416
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:02,970
如果谁想点舒芙蕾吃
Um, if-if we want to order the souffle

417
00:18:02,970 --> 00:18:05,160
现在可以点了
we might want to get on that.

418
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:11,260
莱纳德  希望你别介意  我有些累了
Leonard, if you don't mind, I-I think I'm a little tired.

419
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:12,750
今晚就到这里吧
I'm gonna call it a night.

420
00:18:12,750 --> 00:18:14,120
当然不介意  爸爸
Sure, Dad.

421
00:18:14,120 --> 00:18:15,580
我也有些累坏了
I'm a little tuckered out myself,

422
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:18,030
各位明早见
so I will see you all in the morning.

423
00:18:18,990 --> 00:18:20,110
愿意跟我一起打车吗
Would you like to share a cab?

424
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,370
当然好
That would be fine.

425
00:18:21,370 --> 00:18:22,120
你在哪住
Where are you staying?

426
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,050
威斯汀酒店
I'm at the Westin.

427
00:18:23,050 --> 00:18:24,210
我也是
Oh, so am I.

428
00:18:24,210 --> 00:18:25,540
能请你喝杯睡前酒吗
Can I interest you in a nightcap?

429
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:28,190
当然可以
I think that you could.

430
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:35,210
那是怎么回事
What is happening there?

431
00:18:35,210 --> 00:18:37,440
我觉得再明显不过了
I think it's pretty obvious.

432
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:40,510
他们不想吃甜点  因为吃了一肚子面包
They don't want dessert 'cause they filled up on bread.

433
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:50,420
她还是不接
She's still not answering.

434
00:18:51,900 --> 00:18:54,660
我爸也没回信息
My father's not texting me back.

435
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:59,710
因为他们都关机了啊
'Cause they both turned their phones off.

436
00:19:04,650 --> 00:19:07,030
我一点都不喜欢这样
I don't like this at all.

437
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:09,100
我也不喜欢
I don't like it either.

438
00:19:09,100 --> 00:19:10,610
真的吗
Really?

439
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:12,860
可我爱死了
'Cause I love it.

440
